me\nTreasurer Office\nTreasurers Office\nTreasurer Contact Us\nTreasurer Staff\nUpdate Mortgage Company Information\nDelinquent Tax Payment Options\nMailing Address update\nPayment Information\nFrequently Asked Questions\nVeterans Service Office\nOffice Hours and Location\nNews\nFiling a claim with the V.A.\nOhio Dept. of Veteran's Services\nCustomer Satisfaction Survery\nVA Healthcare Signup\nV.A. Hospital Transportation\nLocal Emergency Room Care\nHonoring Those That Gave The Ultimate Sacrifice\nCounty Water-Sewer\nAgriculture\nAgriculture Overview\nAgricultural Resources\nCrop Production\nFarmland Preservation\nLivestock Production\nBusiness\nEducation and Training\nIndustrial Park, Airport and Available Sites\nManufacturers\nCommunity\nBicentennial Event\nCommunity Overview\nGovernment\nLibraries\nLocal News\nSchools\nQuilt Barn Project\nVisitors\nFestivals\nHeritage and History\nLakes\nLodging and Camping\nRecreation\nTourism\nTrails\nWebsites of Local Interest\nWineries\nRelated Pages\nRelated Pages\nDepartments\nAccounting\nAuditors Office\nChild Support Enforcement Agency\nCommissioners\nCommunity Improvement Corporation\nCoroner's Office\nEmergency Management Agency\nEngineer\nHarrison Hills Schools\nHealth Department\nHoliday Schedule\nJob & Family Services\nMap Office\nHistoric Maps\nOSU Extension Office\nRecorder's Office\nRural Transit\nSheriff's Office\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nThe Harrison County Home\nTreasurer Office\nVeterans Service Office\nCounty Water-Sewer\nDepartments\n/\nMap Office\nMap Office\nTax Map Office & GIS\nThe Tax Map Office is responsible for the review of all property transfers and land surveys within Harrison County. Our office checks all deeds and surveys submitted to be transferred and they are checked for accuracy and adherence to the conveyance standards set forth by the County Engineer and Auditor.\nPre-Approval Process\nConveyance Standards Effective 10/1/2022\nDocument Conveyance Requirements Form\nTransfer Process\nLocal Surveyors\nThe Geographic Information System (GIS) can generate maps and parcel data information to the public.\nTo view the County GIS please click below:\nHarrison County GIS\n*Please note this is a new GIS website will continue to be updated and improved in the coming weeks as the GIS has been transferred under the direction of the Auditor's Office.\nBelow is a link provided by the Auditor's Office in which data is available for download. As an example, shape files are now available for public download by using the link. If you have any questions, please reach out to the Auditor's office at auditor@harrisoncountyohio.gov\nHarrison County Open Data Portal\nContact Information:\nHarrison County Map Office\n100 West Market Street\nCadiz OH 43907\n740-942-8867 · 740-942-3034 (fax)\nmapoffice@harrisoncountyohio.gov\nMonday – Friday 8:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.\nAstachea Thomas, Mapping Clerk\nLinda Little, Assistant Mapping Clerk\nHarrison County\nCommunity Improvement Corporation\nSuite A\n538 North Main Street\nCadiz, OH 43907\nFor individual office phone numbers, click the department tab above.\n© 2026 Harrison County Ohio",
